      "naming": "Files: camelCase .ts, PascalCase .vue, kebab-case plugin file error-handler.ts. Exports: camelCase, UPPER_SNAKE constants; routes/plugins as xRoutes/xPlugin. Tests colocated *.test.ts in web, apps/api/test/ in API. Pkg scope @crate-digger/*; cookie crate_digger_session.",
